1
00:00:13,890 --> 00:00:20,230
Honestly, how long are you going
to keep getting in my way?

2
00:00:20,780 --> 00:00:27,780
Well, this is as far as you go.
The Nano Cannon is complete. Now...

3
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:35,490
...I just press this button
to charge it with energy.

4
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:52,890
Oh no! We have to stop it
before it finishes charging!

5
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:57,300
And I was going to prepare
some little friends for you.

6
00:00:57,300 --> 00:01:00,840
Too bad you'll never see them.
This is where you end.

7
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,060
Hah!

